# text = Does not that first beautiful light denote its pure and perfect rise ; that short conflict between the radiance and the gloom , its successful preservation , by the Apostles and the Fathers ; that rapid fading of the radiance , its desecration in later times ; and the gloom which now surrounds us , the destruction which has encompassed it in this age we live in ?-- a destruction which nothing can avert but a return to that pure first faith that should now be the hope of our religion , as the moon is the hope of night How should we reform ?
