# text = You forget that I have come here to ask your advice , that I am bewildered by a thousand projects , forced on me from all sides , for ruling the city successfully during the blockade ; that I look to you , as a friend and a man of reputation , to aid me in deciding on a choice out of the varied counsels submitted to me in the Senate to-day Write down the advice of each senator on a separate strip of vellum ; shake all the strips together in an urn ; and then , let the first you take out by chance , be your guide to govern by in the present condition of the city Oh friend , friend ! it is cruel to jest with me thus Would you really persuade me that you are ignorant that what sentinels we have , are doubled already on the walls ?
