# text = The people congregate in speechless and hungry mobs at the doors of their houses and the corners of the streets , the sentinels at the ramparts totter on their posts , women and children are sleeping exhausted on the very pavements of the churches , the theatres are emptied of actors and audience alike , the baths resound with cries for food and curses on the Goths , thefts are already committed in the open and unguarded shops , and the barbarians remain fixed in their encampments , unapproached by our promised legions from Ravenna , neither assaulting us in our weakness , nor preparing to raise the blockade !
