# text = I have suffered , since we parted , a bitter affliction , which clings dark and heavy to all my thoughts -- there is no consolation for me but the privilege of caring for your welfare -- my only hope of comfort is in the employment of aiding you Behold Who would sink ignobly beneath the slow superiority of starvation , or perish under the quickly glancing steel of the barbarian conqueror's sword , when such a death as ours is offered to the choice ?-- when wine flows bright , to drown sensation in oblivion , and a palace and its treasures furnish alike the scene of the revel and the radiant funeral pile ?
