# text = ' And you , my five remaining friends , whom -- little desirous of further delay -- I will collectively address , think on the days when the suspicion of an infectious malady in any one of your companions was sufficient to separate you from the dearest of them ; when the slaves who came to you from their palaces underwent long ceremonies of ablution before they approached your presence ; and remembering this , reflect that most , perhaps all of us , now meet here plague-tainted already ; and then say , of what advantage is it to languish for a life which is yours no longer ?
