# text = I have seen parents less anxious for their children , lovers for their mistresses , than you for this girl My destiny is with her I know nothing of the mysteries that the Christians call their " Faith ", but I believe now in the soul ; I believe that one soul contains the fate of another , and that her soul contains the fate of mine Listen since I first saw her , a change came over my whole being ; it was as if her life was mingled with mine !
