# text = Do you see me , weakened , shattered , old before my time ; my friends lost , my fresh feelings of youth gone for ever ; and can you not now comprehend that her life is my life ?-- that if she dies , the one good purpose of my existence is blighted ?-- that I lose all I have henceforth to live for ?-- all , all See the current of life is at its lowest ebb !
